# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (mode=production) and baked into the
# bundle at build time — the production default for the account service the
# sign-in flow talks to. Without a value anywhere the compiled
# `buildEnv("VITE_ACCOUNTS_API")` is "" ("same origin"), which only works when
# the account routes are served by the same host; the desktop bundle hit
# exactly that gap (W27). Real environment variables override this file, so a
# deployment can point elsewhere with `VITE_ACCOUNTS_API=... pnpm build`.
# Dev (`vite` → mode=development) never loads this file — the dev proxy in
# vite.config.ts is the dev story (see /v1 → VITE_ACCOUNTS_PROXY_TARGET).
VITE_ACCOUNTS_API=https://sciencediscovery.openjiuwen.com/accounts
